        "jsCode": "// Spawn one item per quiet project so the AI + email + log steps run per client.\nconst data = $('Compute Quiet Projects').first().json;\nconst quiet = data.projects.filter(p => p.days_quiet >= 10);\nif (!quiet.length) return [];\nreturn quiet.map(p => ({ json: p }));\n"
